      "model": "simulated: written by Claude Code to the epilogue/v3 rules (no model server in the codespace)",
      "text": "Varrowgate declared itself free of both powers. When the War in Heaven began on day 600, it stood against the Empire and the Choir alike. The Hollow Choir's Cathedral fell to Varrowgate. The Shattered Empire offered a treaty, and Varrowgate refused it. Then the Imperial Citadel fell too.\n\nAurel led the storming of the Cathedral. Cassia held the walls against the cluster sieges. Henrik brought down the High Stellarch. He did not live to see the end. Mags refused the Empire's treaty.\n\nVarrowgate answers to no one now. Its walls still stand, scarred and patched. At night the sky above it is quiet, and the colonists sleep."
